          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To divide a fraction by a whole number, we multiply the fraction by the whole number&#x27;s reciprocal.</p>",
            "readable_text": "To divide a fraction by a whole number, we multiply the fraction by the whole number's reciprocal.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Let&#x27;s use this rule to solve the following division problem:</p>",
            "readable_text": "Let's use this rule to solve the following division problem:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac14 \\div {\\color{blue}{3}}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: \\dfrac14 \\div {\\color{blue}{3}}]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>The reciprocal of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\color{blue}3]</span> is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac{1}{{\\color{blue}{3}}}.]</span> So, we have\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac 1 4\\, {\\color{red}\\div} \\, {\\color{blue}3} = \\dfrac 1 4\\, {\\color{red}\\times} \\,\\dfrac{1}{\\color{blue}3}.]</span> </p>",
            "readable_text": "The reciprocal of [MATH: \\color{blue}3] is [MATH: \\dfrac{1}{{\\color{blue}{3}}}.] So, we have\n[MATH: \\dfrac 1 4\\, {\\color{red}\\div} \\, {\\color{blue}3} = \\dfrac 1 4\\, {\\color{red}\\times} \\,\\dfrac{1}{\\color{blue}3}.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Now, we multiply fractions. We multiply the numerators, and we multiply the denominators:\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac 1 4 \\times \\dfrac{1}{3} = \\dfrac {1\\times 1} {4\\times 3} = \\dfrac{1}{12}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Now, we multiply fractions. We multiply the numerators, and we multiply the denominators:\n[MATH: \\dfrac 1 4 \\times \\dfrac{1}{3} = \\dfrac {1\\times 1} {4\\times 3} = \\dfrac{1}{12}]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Therefore, we conclude that</p>",
            "readable_text": "Therefore, we conclude that",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac14 \\div 3 = \\dfrac{1}{12}.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: \\dfrac14 \\div 3 = \\dfrac{1}{12}.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We get the same result by using a fraction model:</p>",
            "readable_text": "We get the same result by using a fraction model:",
            "images": [],
